PICS 0
BACnet Protocol Implementation Conformance Statement
Vendor Name: "Chipkin Automation Systems"
Product Name: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-LS"
Product Model Number: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-LS"
Product Description: "A BACnet/IP Lighting Supervisor built on the CAS BACnet Stack. It presents read-only sensors and commandable outputs, a Lighting Output (Jade), a Channel (Garnet) that fans a WriteGroup out to Jade and to a remote device's Lighting Output and reports in Write_Status whether every member took the value, and a Schedule (Saffron) that writes the Channel on a timer, plus a Calendar (Cream). It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-LS profile."

BACnet Standardized Device Profiles Supported:
{
B-LS - BACnet Lighting Supervisor
}

BIBBs Supported:
{
DS-RP-B
DS-WP-A
DS-WP-B
DS-WG-E-B
DS-ALO-A
SCHED-E-B
DM-DDB-A
DM-DDB-B
DM-DOB-B
DM-DCC-B
DM-TS-B
DM-UTC-B
}

BACnet Standard Application Services Supported:
{
ReadProperty Execute
WriteProperty Initiate Execute
DeviceCommunicationControl Execute
IAm Initiate Execute
IHave Initiate
TimeSynchronization Execute
WhoHas Execute
WhoIs Initiate Execute
UTCTimeSynchronization Execute
WriteGroup Initiate Execute
}

