{
Analog Input
Analog Output
Binary Input
Binary Output
Calendar
Device
Multi-state Input
Multi-state Output
Schedule
Channel
Lighting Output
Network Port
}

Data Link Layer Option:
{
BACnet IP, (Annex J)
}

Character Sets Supported:
{
ISO 10646 (UTF-8) / ANSI X3.4
}

Special Functionality:
{
